00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.600 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:46.640 line:100%
Over the past few days, we've checked in

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.280 line:100%
with taxi drivers and tricycle operators
across several districts.

00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:49.880 line:100%
None of them picked up
any students heading to Yuanlongli.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:50.840 line:100%
What about your side?

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:52.120 line:100%
Did you check

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.240 line:100%
the supermarkets and shops
around the school?

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:56.360 line:100%
We have a lead.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:57.280 line:100%
Han Zi'ang finally spoke.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.280 line:100%
What did he say?

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:01.040 line:100%
Something like this.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.240 line:100%
"Charon.

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.200 line:100%
Charon the ferryman

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:12.400 line:100%
carries souls to Yinyi Village.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.760 line:100%
Horse.

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.440 line:100%
The Trojan Horse.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:17.960 line:100%
It eats people.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.240 line:100%
It's going to eat you."

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:22.760 line:100%
What are you on about?

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:25.600 line:100%
He's not fully recovered yet.

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.160 line:100%
He's rambling about anime stuff.

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.640 line:100%
-Nonsense?
-Not exactly.

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.440 line:100%
Explain that.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.600 line:100%
I can't quite piece it together yet,

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.320 line:100%
but I think what he said

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.040 line:100%
might be connected
to the real-world crime scene.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.120 line:100%
We should try to decipher it.

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.160 line:100%
What kind of outfit
is that for a detective?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.400 line:100%
-I was trying to…
-Enough.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.040 line:100%
Stick to your job.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.640 line:100%
Head back to the hospital
and stay with Han Zi'ang.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.200 line:100%
When he's fully awake, question him again.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:54.960 line:100%
Stop jumping to conclusions.
You're throwing us off.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.120 line:100%
Go on.

00:02:56.840 --> 00:02:58.640 line:100%
We've checked all the shops
around the school

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.160 line:100%
and pulled every camera we could find.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.160 line:100%
Still, nothing unusual turned up.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:13.240 line:20%
WHAT DOES TROJAN HORSE MEAN?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:15.840 line:100%
If Qu Dahai could make sense of that,

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.920 line:100%
he wouldn't be on this Earth anymore.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:21.000 line:100%
It's not entirely his fault.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.880 line:100%
What Han Zi'ang said
isn't easy to figure out.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:33.080 line:100%
If this Yinyi Village

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.560 line:100%
refers to Yuanlongli,

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.600 line:100%
then could Charon the ferryman

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:41.280 line:100%
be some kind of transport?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.560 line:100%
The task force is focusing on vehicles.

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.960 line:100%
Commercial cars and tricycles.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.240 line:100%
What about ride shares?

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:50.600 line:100%
What ride shares?

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:54.200 line:100%
Some shops restock
in the morning and at night.

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.000 line:100%
Drivers pick up extra passengers
along the way.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.760 line:100%
Unlicensed cars like that are too random

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.240 line:100%
to track down.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.960 line:100%
These five kids skipped school,

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.680 line:100%
but none of the road cameras caught them.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.920 line:100%
I think we should check

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.760 line:100%
for construction sites near their school.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:15.920 line:100%
If there is,

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.879 line:100%
it could mess with the cameras.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.280 line:100%
Where's the map? Let me see it.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.240 line:100%
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL,

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.240 line:100%
WEIYANG NO. 2 MIDDLE SCHOOL
WEIYANG NO. 4 MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:49.200 line:100%
Focus here.

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.640 line:100%
BINCHUAN DISTRICT

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.280 line:100%
WEIYANG STADIUM, WENZHUANG

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.680 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:38.080 line:100%
Where're my cigarettes?

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.000 line:100%
I dropped a pack on the road.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.400 line:100%
I'll make it up to you.

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.400 line:100%
It's fine.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:55.000 line:100%
Let me introduce myself.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:57.280 line:100%
I'm Yuan Ziqiang. What about you?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:05:59.920 line:100%
Here's the thing.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.040 line:100%
I'm driving
to the provincial capital today

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.920 line:100%
to meet up with some friends
from my hometown.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.280 line:100%
You've been saying
you want to go to Beijing.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.280 line:100%
There's a train
from the provincial capital.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.680 line:100%
Do you want to hitch a ride?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.160 line:100%
I can drop you off there.

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:25.400 line:100%
About this tall.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.920 line:100%
She's wearing a green jacket
and dark jeans.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.000 line:100%
About this tall.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.200 line:20%
Have you seen this girl?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.960 line:100%
About this tall.
She's wearing a green jacket.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:32.920 line:100%
No.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.280 line:100%
-Mister, have you seen this girl?
-Mister,

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:36.160 line:100%
have you seen this girl?

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.360 line:100%
No.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.920 line:100%
Alright. Thanks.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:43.640 line:100%
-How much?
-Two yuan for half a kilo.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.360 line:100%
Wrap up these three.

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.280 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:06:54.280 --> 00:06:55.240 line:100%
It's hot.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.120 line:100%
Guys,

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:05.280 line:100%
we've checked eight stops.

00:07:05.360 --> 00:07:06.440 line:100%
But there's not a single trace.

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.520 line:100%
That little tyke is probably gone.

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.360 line:100%
At this rate,

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.720 line:100%
we'll still be at it by Chinese New Year.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.120 line:100%
Let's head back

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.080 line:100%
and come up with a new plan.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.840 line:100%
Captain Ran told us to work the route.
There has to be a reason.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:20.920 line:100%
Finish up and keep going.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.640 line:100%
He's here.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:28.480 line:100%
How's it going here?

00:07:29.640 --> 00:07:31.800 line:100%
We've got this covered.
Why don't you get some rest?

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:32.920 line:100%
-You've been running yourself ragged.
-Here.

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:34.640 line:100%
Grab a bite.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.560 line:100%
He Xiaohe is just
as insensible as her dad.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.440 line:100%
Look at what she's doing to Captain Ran.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.560 line:100%
Don't say that.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.240 line:100%
I share the blame
for what happened to her.

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:45.720 line:100%
If I hadn't pushed Sir
to take on that case,

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:48.040 line:100%
his family might not have fallen apart.

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.760 line:100%
You keep calling him "Sir".

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:52.120 line:100%
Does He Yuanhang even deserve that?

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:57.760 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.640 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.080 line:100%
Did we check the supermarket?

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.640 line:100%
We just got to this street
and are about to check it out.

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:20.720 line:100%
<i>"Suddenly, over the stream</i>
<i>We heard a pipa sound</i>

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:24.200 line:100%
<i>I forgot to go home,</i>
<i>And the guest stood spell-bound"</i>

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:27.000 line:100%
Pen. Pen.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.240 line:100%
<i>"Song of a Pipa Player,</i> by Bai Juyi.

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:33.880 line:100%
In the tenth year of Yuanhe's reign…"

00:08:33.959 --> 00:08:35.359 line:100%
What can I get you, misters?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:37.200 line:100%
We're with the Nanshan Branch.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.320 line:100%
Have you seen this girl?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.920 line:100%
MISSING PERSONS

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:45.920 line:20%
Have you seen her?

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:54.840 line:100%
Go back to your studies.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:03.240 line:100%
<i>"Suddenly, over the stream</i>
<i>We heard a pipa sound</i>

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:06.480 line:100%
<i>I forgot to go home,</i>
<i>and the guest stood spell-bound.</i>

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.160 line:100%
<i>We followed the music to its source,</i>

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:12.840 line:100%
<i>but heard the pipa stop,</i>
<i>and no music in the air.</i>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.320 line:100%
<i>We moved our boat towards</i>
<i>the one whence came the strain,</i>

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.440 line:100%
<i>brought back the lamp,</i>
<i>asked for more wine and drank again.</i>

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.880 line:100%
<i>Repeatedly, we called</i>
<i>For the fair player still"</i>

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:26.920 line:100%
Your son is working hard.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.280 line:100%
He's in high school,
but his grades aren't great.

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:31.560 line:100%
So I keep an eye on his studies.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:32.800 line:100%
Recite it again.

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:34.760 line:100%
<i>"Song of a Pipa Player,</i> by Bai Juyi.

00:09:35.560 --> 00:09:36.680 line:100%
In the tenth year of Yuanhe's reign…"

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.400 line:100%
Let's move on to the next shop.

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.440 line:100%
Take care.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.920 line:100%
Putting on a show is way harder

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.800 line:100%
than gaming.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.360 line:100%
When that girl gets back with supplies,

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:58.600 line:100%
I'm going to send her home.

00:09:58.680 --> 00:10:00.840 line:100%
-I'm heading inside to practice.
-Hold on.

00:10:01.440 --> 00:10:03.400 line:100%
Wait till the cops are out of sight.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.040 line:100%
We haven't checked
a hardware store up ahead,

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.960 line:100%
a barbershop, and a mahjong parlor.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.960 line:100%
Wait. Stay here.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:14.080 line:100%
Wait?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.080 line:100%
How long?

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:20.640 line:100%
Five minutes. We'll go back to that shop.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.880 line:100%
Hurry up. Cover for me.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:29.960 line:100%
Come on.

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:43.800 line:100%
Is he your son too?

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.200 line:100%
You do magic tricks,

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:52.840 line:100%
and your son changes faces.

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.120 line:100%
Five minutes, and he has lost weight?

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:01.560 line:100%
Officer, I want to come clean.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.840 line:100%
I saw that girl.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.960 line:100%
<i>Everyone, look to your left.</i>

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:12.240 line:100%
<i>This is the first stop</i>
<i>of our Mount Wu tour.</i>

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:13.520 line:100%
<i>Seeing flowers in the fog.</i>

00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:15.720 line:100%
<i>If we come back in three or four months,</i>

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.000 line:100%
<i>you'll see flowers in the fog</i>

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.640 line:100%
<i>and fog among the flowers.</i>

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.600 line:20%
<i>The heavier the fog,</i>

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.080 line:20%
<i>the more dangerous it is</i>
<i>to head up to the mountain.</i>

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:26.080 line:100%
<i>Back on August 24th, 1995,</i>

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:28.160 line:100%
<i>there was an accident.</i>

00:11:28.240 --> 00:11:29.840 line:100%
<i>So once you reach the resort,</i>

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.040 line:100%
<i>remember this, do not</i>
<i>go up the mountain on your own.</i>

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:51.720 line:100%
JINGLIAN TEMPLE TUNNEL

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:52.800 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.480 line:100%
You're not a trafficker, are you?

00:12:14.680 --> 00:12:15.640 line:100%
Sorry?

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:18.560 line:100%
You're not a trafficker, are you?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.880 line:100%
Get off at the next stop.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:26.720 line:100%
Find your own way back.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:40.520 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.200 line:100%
Mangkun, head over to Nanhu Market.

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:43.840 line:100%
Talk to the vendors.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:47.840 line:100%
Find out who she hung out with.

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:49.600 line:100%
What about the four of them?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:53.040 line:100%
IDs.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.320 line:100%
We…

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:55.800 line:100%
We don't have IDs.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:58.880 line:100%
They're in the cybercafé without IDs?

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:01.240 line:100%
Officer, this is an illegal cybercafé.

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:03.560 line:100%
It's not his fault. We're all over 18.

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.920 line:100%
We sold our IDs for money

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.760 line:100%
to pay for our training and competitions.

00:13:07.840 --> 00:13:10.040 line:100%
This is gaming, not a competition.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.200 line:100%
Qu.

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.200 line:100%
-Do you have surveillance here?
-Yes.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.360 line:100%
Officer, this is the footage
from the past week.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:39.160 line:100%
Officer,

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:41.600 line:100%
we really did see her passed out
in the alley late at night.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.160 line:100%
We were afraid she'd freeze,
so we brought her back.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:46.280 line:100%
This money-grabber squeezes
money out of us every day.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.320 line:100%
Even if you break wind here,

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:50.520 line:100%
she'll chase you down and charge you
an air pollution fee.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:51.560 line:100%
Sometimes,

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.040 line:100%
when Xiaohe saw us training hard,

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.000 line:100%
she would chip in
and buy us instant noodles.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:58.280 line:100%
Yeah. She's not stingy.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.640 line:100%
She said she was saving up
to go to Beijing.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:01.480 line:100%
Beijing?

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:03.840 line:100%
-To learn rock music.
-That's right.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.040 line:100%
Go to Beijing to learn rock music.

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:07.000 line:100%
When did she say that?

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.080 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
DONGLIWA STATION

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:28.920 line:100%
We'll stay there for the night.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.040 line:100%
Didn't you say we were leaving today?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.560 line:100%
My friend said
some of them haven't arrived yet.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:37.240 line:100%
We'll head out together tomorrow
once everyone's here.

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:46.600 line:100%
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.840 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:15.560 line:100%
Come on in.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:24.120 line:100%
Kid,

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.120 line:100%
you're suspicious of everything.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:29.800 line:100%
Take a look at this.

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:36.160 line:100%
YUAN ZIQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:40.360 line:100%
I'm not lying, right?

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:41.280 line:100%
CITIZEN IDENTIFICATION

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.640 line:100%
You can have it if you want.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:56.800 line:100%
Captain Ran, look at this.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:01.440 line:100%
This is footage from 11:05 a.m.

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:02.920 line:100%
After this man

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.680 line:100%
gave Xiaohe some money, she headed out

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:06.880 line:100%
and hasn't come back since.

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:12.880 line:100%
That guy with the glasses

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.720 line:100%
always had Xiaohe
pick up cigarettes for him.

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:16.920 line:100%
He never asked for change.
He's really generous.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:32.640 line:100%
What do you do for a living?

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.600 line:100%
Construction.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.720 line:100%
I go back and forth between Weiyang
and the provincial capital very often.

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:38.800 line:100%
And you?

00:16:38.880 --> 00:16:41.120 line:100%
I noticed you've been staying
at the cybercafé every night.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.760 line:100%
Doesn't your family check on you?

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:00.120 line:100%
Alright. Food's almost ready.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.720 line:100%
Instant noodles again?

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:09.360 line:100%
I eat that three times a day
at the cybercafé.

00:17:09.879 --> 00:17:11.600 line:100%
It makes me sick just looking at it now.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:13.200 line:100%
Mister,

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:16.040 line:100%
can you buy me a proper meal?

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:25.720 line:100%
Little kid,

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.919 line:100%
you're such a hassle.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.000 line:100%
Don't wander off.

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:39.640 line:100%
It's not safe out there.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.040 line:100%
You might get snatched.

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.760 line:100%
-Who has the wanted list?
-I do.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.720 line:100%
I picked up this habit at the station.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:20.080 line:100%
I always carry it with me
whenever I'm out.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:20.760 line:100%
WANTED LIST

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.320 line:100%
Let me introduce myself.

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:47.600 line:100%
I'm Yuan Ziqiang. And you?

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:49.640 line:100%
Take a look at this.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:52.400 line:100%
LI QIANGYOU'S IDENTITY CARD

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:55.720 line:20%
LI HANGXING, "MEI" PROFILE

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:02.240 line:20%
"MEI" PROFILE

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:07.360 line:20%
HAO YOUQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.600 line:100%
I'm not lying, right?

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:17.960 line:100%
You can keep it if you want.

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.400 line:100%
YUAN ZIQIANG'S IDENTITY CARD

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.640 line:20%
GAO ZHIQIANG
XIANG ZHIQIANG

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.200 line:20%
Looks like him?

00:19:31.800 --> 00:19:32.920 line:100%
Yes, that's Mei.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:35.640 line:100%
If Xiaohe has caught his attention,

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:36.720 line:100%
it's trouble.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.400 line:100%
Mei is skilled at disguising himself.

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.960 line:100%
I bought you some meat buns.

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:26.560 line:100%
Yes. That's about it.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:29.320 line:100%
Please contact us
as soon as you hear anything.

00:20:29.400 --> 00:20:30.440 line:100%
Alright. Thank you.

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:33.760 line:100%
Captain Ran, we've contacted
the traffic police.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:35.200 line:100%
They're pulling nearby
surveillance footage now.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.080 line:100%
Liu, get more people on it.

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:38.440 line:100%
Alright.

00:20:40.120 --> 00:20:41.840 line:100%
We've informed neighboring stations.

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:52.160 line:100%
Hello?

00:20:52.240 --> 00:20:55.040 line:100%
<i>Captain Ran, Xiaohe left</i>
<i>Nanhu Market around 4 p.m.</i>

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.800 line:100%
<i>Seven or eight vendors saw her.</i>

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.160 line:100%
Got it.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:04.600 line:100%
Which bus runs from Nanhu Market?

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.240 line:100%
Route 15.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.360 line:100%
The stop should be
across from the main gate.

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:09.880 line:20%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
YANGLIU STREET

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:42.200 line:100%
When did the patrol car park there?

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:44.880 line:100%
Around 4:30 p.m.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:47.560 line:100%
The patrol car scared her off.

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.240 line:100%
Xiaohe can't have been gone
for more than two hours.

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:52.600 line:100%
Based on a two-hour walking range,

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:54.160 line:100%
expand the search radius. Move.

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:55.240 line:100%
-Alright.
-Okay.

00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:03.400 line:100%
WANG MANGKUN

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:08.480 line:100%
Hello, Mangkun?

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:10.680 line:100%
Head to the Route 15 terminal.

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:12.960 line:100%
Check with the drivers and conductors
and see if anyone spotted Xiaohe

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:14.040 line:100%
on the 4 p.m. run.

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:15.440 line:100%
Make it quick.

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.640 line:100%
ROUTE 15

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:25.960 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG
YANGLIU STREET

00:22:32.520 --> 00:22:34.120 line:20%
Do you have a phone charger?

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:35.920 line:20%
Yeah. I'll have someone bring one.

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:37.200 line:100%
Alright. Thanks.

00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:39.640 line:100%
Officer He, this is a local specialty.

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:41.160 line:100%
Try it. It's sweet.

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:43.160 line:100%
Thank you. Thank you.

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:48.040 line:100%
Officer He,

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.760 line:100%
weren't the Xus

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:53.480 line:100%
already taken by that
demon building in Weiyang?

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:54.840 line:100%
You actually believe that?

00:22:56.840 --> 00:22:59.120 line:100%
Officer He, to be frank,

00:22:59.200 --> 00:23:01.120 line:100%
those two

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:02.880 line:100%
were harder to deal with than any demon.

00:23:05.680 --> 00:23:07.000 line:100%
Back then, after the mountain accident,

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.000 line:100%
the government had
the travel agency and the scenic area

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:12.120 line:100%
reach out to the victims' families
about compensation.

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.880 line:100%
We went door to door.

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:15.880 line:100%
The Xu family signed,

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:17.560 line:100%
and we paid them.

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:20.120 line:100%
By right, that should've settled it.

00:23:20.200 --> 00:23:21.960 line:100%
But not long after,

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.560 line:100%
Xu Meng showed up again
with her dad in a wheelchair.

00:23:23.640 --> 00:23:25.720 line:100%
She said the medical fees weren't enough

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.520 line:100%
and demanded another payout.

00:23:27.600 --> 00:23:29.960 line:100%
We were at our wits' end,

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:31.280 line:100%
so we gave them
another compensation payment.

00:23:31.360 --> 00:23:33.560 line:100%
But before long, she came back again

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:34.840 line:100%
and started causing trouble.

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:37.040 line:100%
There was no way
we were paying them again.

00:23:37.840 --> 00:23:38.920 line:100%
When we refused,

00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:41.760 line:100%
she went after the scenic area staff
and harassed them instead.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:43.600 line:100%
To be honest, Officer He,

00:23:43.680 --> 00:23:46.520 line:100%
the way those two acted was disgraceful.

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.400 line:100%
Is the accident investigation report
still available?

00:23:52.120 --> 00:23:53.320 line:100%
Yes. It's all still here.

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:12.280 line:100%
<i>THE SUTRA OF INFINITE LIFE</i>

00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:41.360 line:100%
ANCIENT TOWN INN

00:24:42.840 --> 00:24:44.600 line:100%
ANCIENT TOWN

00:24:53.640 --> 00:24:56.560 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:07.280 line:20%
AMITĀYUS SUTRA

00:25:33.560 --> 00:25:34.760 line:100%
Heading out?

00:25:41.720 --> 00:25:43.240 line:100%
I… It'll take hours

00:25:43.320 --> 00:25:44.480 line:100%
to get to the provincial capital.

00:25:45.080 --> 00:25:48.440 line:100%
I want to pick up some food for the trip.

00:25:48.520 --> 00:25:50.040 line:100%
That's not enough for you?

00:25:50.720 --> 00:25:53.080 line:100%
It's all instant noodles and sausages.

00:25:53.160 --> 00:25:55.080 line:100%
Even the buns have gone cold.

00:25:55.160 --> 00:25:56.560 line:100%
I want to get some bread.

00:25:59.840 --> 00:26:01.920 line:100%
You're quite a handful.

00:26:02.880 --> 00:26:05.840 line:100%
There's a general store across the street.
It's cheaper there.

00:26:06.640 --> 00:26:07.560 line:100%
Okay.

00:26:35.560 --> 00:26:37.120 line:100%
-What's wrong, girl?
-Madam,

00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:38.840 line:100%
I ran into some bad people.

00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:40.560 line:100%
Can I borrow your phone
to call the police?

00:26:40.640 --> 00:26:42.440 line:100%
Quick. Use the phone inside.

00:26:48.360 --> 00:26:50.600 line:100%
Madam, where is it?

00:26:50.680 --> 00:26:51.920 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:26:54.160 --> 00:26:55.200 line:100%
Help!

00:27:29.840 --> 00:27:32.080 line:100%
<i>Uncle Ran, help me…</i>

00:27:42.160 --> 00:27:44.000 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

00:27:48.200 --> 00:27:49.320 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:56.200 line:100%
DONGLIWA STATION, YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:28:04.800 --> 00:28:05.920 line:100%
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:10.960 line:100%
HAPPY

00:28:11.040 --> 00:28:13.600 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

00:29:02.200 --> 00:29:04.240 line:100%
Officer He, sorry to keep you waiting.

00:29:04.320 --> 00:29:05.440 line:100%
He should be here any minute.

00:29:05.520 --> 00:29:06.840 line:100%
It's okay.

00:29:11.760 --> 00:29:13.240 line:100%
Hurry it up.

00:29:14.000 --> 00:29:15.680 line:100%
All you do all day is play games.

00:29:15.760 --> 00:29:17.040 line:100%
You've kept Officer He waiting this long.

00:29:18.440 --> 00:29:19.360 line:100%
It's alright.

00:29:19.440 --> 00:29:21.120 line:100%
Kids will be kids.

00:29:21.200 --> 00:29:22.560 line:100%
My daughter's the same.

00:29:22.640 --> 00:29:24.240 line:100%
As long as they're safe

00:29:24.320 --> 00:29:25.520 line:100%
and by our side, that's enough.

00:29:25.600 --> 00:29:27.720 line:100%
-Let's go.
-Come.

00:29:33.880 --> 00:29:34.760 line:100%
Is this the one?

00:29:34.840 --> 00:29:36.000 line:100%
Yes, this is it.

00:29:36.080 --> 00:29:38.000 line:100%
Right. Officer He, this is the file.

00:29:39.040 --> 00:29:39.880 line:100%
ARCHIVE

00:29:39.960 --> 00:29:41.000 line:100%
AUGUST 24TH MOUNT WU ACCIDENT REPORT

00:29:43.240 --> 00:29:44.080 line:100%
There's quite a lot here.

00:29:46.000 --> 00:29:47.120 line:100%
Could I get a copy?

00:29:47.200 --> 00:29:48.600 line:100%
I'd like to take it back
and go through it carefully.

00:29:48.680 --> 00:29:49.520 line:100%
Of course. No problem.

00:29:49.600 --> 00:29:50.840 line:100%
Come. Make a copy for Officer He.

00:29:51.480 --> 00:29:53.240 line:100%
That's a lot. How long will it take?

00:29:53.320 --> 00:29:55.240 line:100%
My friends are waiting for me
at the cybercafé.

00:29:55.320 --> 00:29:56.560 line:100%
Cybercafé, my foot.

00:29:56.640 --> 00:29:58.040 line:100%
Get it copied now.

00:30:06.200 --> 00:30:08.880 line:100%
ROUTE 15 WEIYANG STADIUM TO WENZHUANG

00:30:11.840 --> 00:30:13.480 line:100%
This is the last stop. Get off the bus.

00:30:14.320 --> 00:30:15.200 line:100%
Mm.

00:30:28.760 --> 00:30:29.720 line:100%
Any updates?

00:30:29.800 --> 00:30:32.120 line:100%
<i>Captain Ran, a conductor saw Xiaohe.</i>

00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:33.320 line:100%
<i>She was with Mei.</i>

00:30:33.400 --> 00:30:36.040 line:100%
<i>They got off at the stop</i>
<i>near Youcheng Hotel.</i>

00:30:36.120 --> 00:30:37.640 line:100%
Youcheng Hotel?

00:30:38.240 --> 00:30:39.400 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:30:42.280 --> 00:30:43.280 line:100%
Sir.

00:30:43.360 --> 00:30:44.560 line:100%
Sir. Sir.

00:30:46.360 --> 00:30:48.240 line:100%
-You have a death wish…
-Police.

00:30:48.320 --> 00:30:50.560 line:20%
You should've said so earlier.

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:53.720 line:100%
Sir, pull over.

00:30:55.640 --> 00:30:56.720 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:31:01.120 --> 00:31:02.080 line:100%
Police.

00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:04.360 line:100%
Have you seen these two?

00:31:07.400 --> 00:31:09.640 line:100%
Yes. Room 206.

00:31:09.720 --> 00:31:10.800 line:100%
They checked out.

00:31:12.880 --> 00:31:14.360 line:100%
MANAGER'S OFFICE

00:31:21.120 --> 00:31:22.480 line:100%
Pause.

00:31:23.960 --> 00:31:25.000 line:100%
Give me that.

00:31:42.120 --> 00:31:43.040 line:100%
Do you have cameras outside?

00:31:43.120 --> 00:31:46.120 line:100%
We're a small business.
We don't have that many cameras.

00:31:46.200 --> 00:31:47.960 line:100%
YOUCHENG HOTEL

00:31:59.320 --> 00:32:00.600 line:100%
HAPPY SHOPPING MART

00:32:01.640 --> 00:32:02.840 line:100%
Do you have the phone number

00:32:02.920 --> 00:32:04.080 line:100%
-for the shop owner across the street?
-Yes.

00:32:04.160 --> 00:32:05.080 line:100%
Let me find it.

00:32:06.160 --> 00:32:08.560 line:100%
The owner went back to their hometown.
The shop's been closed for a week.

00:32:09.240 --> 00:32:10.360 line:100%
Back home?

00:32:11.360 --> 00:32:14.360 line:100%
-I saw her locking up just an hour ago.
-That's impossible.

00:32:14.440 --> 00:32:15.680 line:100%
What does the owner look like?

00:32:15.760 --> 00:32:16.840 line:100%
A tall, thin woman?

00:32:16.920 --> 00:32:19.400 line:100%
It's a retired old man.
He has no children.

00:32:57.040 --> 00:32:58.120 line:20%
CHUAN N 97023

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:02.480 line:100%
CHUAN N 97023

00:33:12.400 --> 00:33:13.320 line:100%
<i>Fangxu.</i>

00:33:13.840 --> 00:33:16.360 line:100%
Contact the traffic police to run a plate.

00:33:16.440 --> 00:33:19.080 line:100%
Chuan N 97023, silver van.

00:33:19.160 --> 00:33:21.080 line:100%
Xiaohe might be inside. Faster.

00:33:30.080 --> 00:33:31.480 line:100%
MENTOR

00:33:44.880 --> 00:33:46.040 line:100%
RAN

00:33:48.200 --> 00:33:50.560 line:100%
Hello? Why are you still up?

00:33:53.280 --> 00:33:54.280 line:100%
Sir.

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:55.920 line:100%
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:33:56.000 --> 00:33:57.440 line:100%
<i>Did something happen?</i>

00:33:59.600 --> 00:34:00.600 line:100%
Yes.

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:07.080 line:100%
What happened? Just tell me.

00:34:10.320 --> 00:34:11.439 line:100%
Xiaohe

00:34:12.080 --> 00:34:13.600 line:100%
has been taken by human traffickers.

00:34:15.439 --> 00:34:17.640 line:100%
<i>I've got people tracking the vehicle.</i>

00:34:18.840 --> 00:34:20.519 line:100%
<i>They should still be in Weiyang.</i>

00:34:21.039 --> 00:34:23.400 line:100%
<i>All the exits are covered.</i>

00:34:31.800 --> 00:34:33.200 line:100%
Please send those printed files

00:34:33.280 --> 00:34:34.800 line:100%
to the Nanshan District Police Station.

00:34:35.320 --> 00:34:36.200 line:100%
-Thank you.
-It's okay.

00:34:36.280 --> 00:34:37.400 line:100%
Sure. Take your time.

00:34:42.080 --> 00:34:43.800 line:100%
Pull over. Pull over.

00:34:44.880 --> 00:34:45.640 line:100%
Sir.

00:34:48.760 --> 00:34:50.439 line:100%
Pull over. Sir.

00:34:54.560 --> 00:34:55.439 line:100%
-Where to?
-Weiyang.

00:35:06.040 --> 00:35:07.400 line:100%
CHUAN N 97023

00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:13.960 line:100%
Hurry. Get her in the van.

00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:15.760 line:100%
You idiot.

00:35:15.840 --> 00:35:17.200 line:100%
Cut back on the buns.

00:35:17.280 --> 00:35:19.200 line:100%
I said cut back. Cut back.
All you ever do is eat.

00:35:19.280 --> 00:35:20.320 line:100%
Hurry up.

00:35:24.960 --> 00:35:29.040 line:100%
CHUAN N 97023

00:35:31.120 --> 00:35:32.560 line:100%
If we pull this off,

00:35:33.160 --> 00:35:34.440 line:100%
this is a big score.

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:40.240 line:100%
<i>Fangxu, 15 minutes ago,</i>

00:35:40.320 --> 00:35:41.440 line:100%
<i>traffic cams picked up the van</i>

00:35:41.520 --> 00:35:43.480 line:100%
<i>heading west past the train station.</i>

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:45.880 line:100%
Everyone to the station.
Set up along the route.

00:35:45.960 --> 00:35:46.920 line:100%
<i>Copy that.</i>

00:35:56.120 --> 00:35:57.200 line:100%
MENTOR

00:36:00.800 --> 00:36:02.680 line:100%
-Sir.
-I'm almost in Weiyang.

00:36:02.760 --> 00:36:04.480 line:100%
<i>Where is the trafficker?</i>
<i>Have you locked onto them?</i>

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:06.240 line:100%
They're heading toward
Weiyang Train Station.

00:36:06.320 --> 00:36:07.200 line:100%
Got it.

00:36:07.720 --> 00:36:09.080 line:100%
Train station, sir. Faster.

00:36:15.040 --> 00:36:16.320 line:100%
We've got two kids in the van.

00:36:18.440 --> 00:36:19.440 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:36:27.880 --> 00:36:29.080 line:100%
Alright. I got it.

00:36:33.520 --> 00:36:35.520 line:100%
Mei said he picked up a nine-year-old boy.

00:36:36.280 --> 00:36:37.200 line:100%
He's waiting at the usual spot.

00:36:49.760 --> 00:36:54.600 line:100%
WEI TUNNEL 9

00:36:55.840 --> 00:36:58.320 line:100%
<i>One minute ago, the van</i>
<i>was seen on camera heading south</i>

00:36:58.400 --> 00:37:00.600 line:100%
<i>through Wei Tunnel 9 on Highway 410.</i>

00:37:13.560 --> 00:37:15.000 line:100%
MENTOR

00:37:15.880 --> 00:37:17.600 line:100%
-Sir.
-What's the plate number?

00:37:17.680 --> 00:37:19.960 line:100%
Chuan N 97023. Silver van.

00:37:20.040 --> 00:37:22.200 line:100%
<i>Just passed the Wei Tunnel 9,</i>
<i>heading south.</i>

00:37:22.280 --> 00:37:23.360 line:100%
I'll cut it from outside the city.

00:37:23.440 --> 00:37:24.760 line:100%
Same plan. Block them from both ends.

00:37:25.400 --> 00:37:26.480 line:100%
Got it.

00:37:27.360 --> 00:37:28.720 line:100%
Sir, faster, please.

00:37:28.800 --> 00:37:29.920 line:100%
Thank you.

00:38:07.000 --> 00:38:08.720 line:100%
Mei says there's
a checkpoint on the highway.

00:38:08.800 --> 00:38:10.640 line:100%
Take a left at the next junction.
There's a repair shop.

00:38:10.720 --> 00:38:11.880 line:100%
He'll wait there.

00:38:33.440 --> 00:38:34.840 line:100%
Turn right on the highway.

00:38:38.200 --> 00:38:39.400 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:38:41.720 --> 00:38:42.960 line:100%
Drive.

00:38:43.040 --> 00:38:44.080 line:100%
We're out of gas.
We're not going anywhere.

00:38:44.160 --> 00:38:46.320 line:100%
-No?
-Out of gas.

00:39:17.040 --> 00:39:18.480 line:100%
Still trying to run?

00:39:18.560 --> 00:39:19.480 line:100%
Dare to run?

00:39:19.560 --> 00:39:20.680 line:100%
You think you can run away?

00:39:22.040 --> 00:39:23.800 line:100%
Hold her down.

00:39:24.320 --> 00:39:25.160 line:100%
Help!

00:39:27.880 --> 00:39:28.840 line:100%
Hit her.

00:39:31.480 --> 00:39:33.480 line:100%
Dare to run away? Now?

00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:35.880 line:100%
Run? Asking for death?

00:39:45.120 --> 00:39:46.480 line:100%
I'm going to beat you up!

00:39:50.760 --> 00:39:52.240 line:100%
You rascal.

00:39:53.080 --> 00:39:54.360 line:100%
Step on it.

00:39:54.440 --> 00:39:55.840 line:100%
Get in the car,

00:39:55.920 --> 00:39:57.680 line:100%
or you're dead.

00:39:58.520 --> 00:40:00.360 line:100%
Throw me out if you dare.

00:40:00.440 --> 00:40:02.280 line:100%
Fine, you're dead.

00:40:13.120 --> 00:40:14.640 line:100%
-Get out!
-Are you crazy?

00:40:14.720 --> 00:40:16.720 line:100%
-Police. Everyone out of the vehicle!
-Dad!

00:40:16.800 --> 00:40:18.000 line:100%
-Dad, I'm here!
-Out!

00:40:18.080 --> 00:40:19.320 line:100%
Dad, I'm here!

00:40:20.520 --> 00:40:22.120 line:100%
-Run him over.
-Dad!

00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:24.760 line:100%
-Help!
-Step on the gas!

00:40:24.840 --> 00:40:26.680 line:100%
-He's a cop.
-You chickened out?

00:40:26.760 --> 00:40:27.680 line:100%
All of you, out!

00:40:27.760 --> 00:40:28.640 line:100%
-Run him over!
-Dad!

00:40:28.720 --> 00:40:29.600 line:100%
Help!

00:40:29.680 --> 00:40:30.640 line:100%
Quick!

00:40:32.680 --> 00:40:34.480 line:100%
Dad! Dad!

00:40:42.200 --> 00:40:43.960 line:100%
-Get out!
-Help me!

00:40:44.040 --> 00:40:46.200 line:100%
Get out! Get out!

00:40:46.280 --> 00:40:47.560 line:100%
Move!

00:40:48.360 --> 00:40:49.800 line:100%
-Don't hit my dad!
-Move!

00:40:49.880 --> 00:40:51.640 line:100%
I said get out!

00:40:52.800 --> 00:40:53.680 line:100%
Out of my way!

00:40:54.480 --> 00:40:55.760 line:100%
Don't hit my dad!

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:57.640 line:100%
I won't forgive you!

00:41:00.600 --> 00:41:02.680 line:100%
-Step on it.
-Don't hit my dad!

00:41:02.760 --> 00:41:04.160 line:100%
Run him over!

00:41:08.720 --> 00:41:10.160 line:100%
Dad!

00:41:10.240 --> 00:41:11.400 line:100%
Dad!